hopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rd3q-lvkqwh3v4yqv85', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F872473112%2F22593050902', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
