acinamide #Vitamin C ------------------------------------------------------------ ------------------------------------------------------------ ----------------------------------------------- ❤Three Promises of KOKSARA COSMETICS 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.✔ 2.We sell 100% genuine.✔ 3.Chatable time: all the time [24/7].', 170.4, 129.0, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Toner', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/dddbb6b379c36840ac7d271006e9cf1b', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F15411569501', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
