 Asus e muito mais!', 269.1, 214.67, NULL, 'Computers & Accessories > Desktop & Laptop Components > Others', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-8259f-mqtnohea9fd73c', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F392651618%2F11962518564', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
