com embalagem: 20,6 cm Peso com embalagem: 2,517 kg Garantia: 360 Dias', 159.9, 159.9, NULL, 'Home Appliances > Kitchen Appliances > Juicers, Blenders & Soya Bean Machines', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rdxd-mbww5fa63qz222', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1215229492%2F23498698243', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
