tificado de garantia', 755.0, 650.0, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Internal Accessories for Automobiles > Car Audio System', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/88b419aec195b14be4c6e9831b2bdc8d', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F411081274%2F10216502145', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
