Chill Pink - tom de rosa legal profundo (seca mudada rosa) Hip So Go Day 19 - moderno sombra de ameixa escura', 164.32, 65.0, NULL, 'Beauty > Makeup > Lips', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-8262h-mlmyiemretjc2b', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F25917239973', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
